#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:34
msgid ""
"This module lets you configure the look of the whole workspace with some "
"ready to go presets."
msgstr ""
"Esti módulu déxate configurar l'aspeutu de tola estaya de trabayu con dellos "
"preaxustes preparaos pa usar."

#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:41
msgid ""
"Select an overall theme for your workspace (including plasma theme, color "
"scheme, mouse cursor, window and desktop switcher, splash screen, lock "
"screen etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Esbilla un tema d'aspeutu y sentir xeneral pa la to estaya de trabayu "
"(incluyendo l'esquema de color, ventanes, mur, la pantalla de chiscadura, de "
"bloquéu... etc)"

